Lifestyle Image – Product being used naturally in a real-life setting.
Problem → Solution – Shows a relatable problem and positions the product as one option to address it.
Educational Infographic – Teaches something useful while featuring the product subtly.
Benefits Graphic – Highlights 3–5 key benefits with strong visual design.
Social Proof – Uses a genuine customer review alongside the product.
Premium Brand Image – Minimal, elegant photography that builds trust and reinforces a premium brand.
